        "original_id": "bed00314-12fc-5155-9319-4eb432ee663b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Miklos Wright, Kevin Costner, Michael Jeter, Bill Costner, Sharon Costner\n- Works: Open Range, Mr. Brooks, Southland, Chicago P.D.\n- Topics: film editing, dedications, final on-screen appearances\n\nFacts:\n- Miklos Wright is an American film editor.\n- Miklos Wright's notable editing work includes Open Range and Mr. Brooks, both of which starred Kevin Costner.\n- Miklos Wright also worked on multiple episodes of Southland and Chicago P.D.\n- Open Range was Michael Jeter's final on-screen appearance.\n- Michael Jeter died before Open Range was released.\n- Open Range was dedicated to the memory of Michael Jeter and to the memory of Kevin Costner's parents, Bill Costner and Sharon Costner.",
